1045810-26-000052":{"c":"NVDA","form":"10-Q","filed":"2026-05-20"},"0001045810-26-000075":{"c":"NVDA","form":"10-Q","filed":"2026-08-26"},"0001045810-24-000264":{"c":"NVDA","form":"10-Q","filed":"2024-08-28"}},"finsights":{"NVDA":[{"topic":"fcf","text":"Free cash flow was $96.7 billion in FY2026: operating cash flow of $103 billion less capital spending of $6 billion (computed from two filed figures). That is 44.8% of revenue.","cites":["NVDA.ocf.2026","NVDA.capex.2026","NVDA.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"sbc","text":"Stock-based compensation was $6.4 billion in FY2026, 3% of revenue, against 8.4% in FY2021.","cites":["NVDA.sbc.2026","NVDA.revenue.2026","NVDA.sbc.2021","NVDA.revenue.2021"]},{"topic":"returns","text":"In FY2026 the company paid $40.1 billion to repurchase its own shares and $974 million in dividends: $41.1 billion together (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["NVDA.buybacks.2026","NVDA.dividends.2026"]},{"topic":"quarter","text":"In the three months ended 2026-07-26 revenue was $96.2 billion, up 105.9% from $46.7 billion in the three months ended 2025-07-27.","cites":["NVDA.d.revenue.2026-04-27.2026-07-26","NVDA.d.revenue.2025-04-28.2025-07-27"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Over the four quarters to 2026-07-26 revenue added up to $303 billion (computed from five filed figures), operating income to $198 billion and net income to $193 billion.","cites":["NVDA.d.revenue.2025-07-28.2025-10-26","NVDA.d.revenue.2025-01-27.2026-01-25","NVDA.d.revenue.2025-01-27.2025-10-26","NVDA.d.revenue.2026-01-26.2026-04-26","NVDA.d.revenue.2026-04-27.2026-07-26","NVDA.d.opinc.2025-07-28.2025-10-26","NVDA.d.opinc.2025-01-27.2026-01-25","NVDA.d.opinc.2025-01-27.2025-10-26","NVDA.d.opinc.2026-01-26.2026-04-26","NVDA.d.opinc.2026-04-27.2026-07-26","NVDA.d.netinc.2025-07-28.2025-10-26","NVDA.d.netinc.2025-01-27.2026-01-25","NVDA.d.netinc.2025-01-27.2025-10-26","NVDA.d.netinc.2026-01-26.2026-04-26","NVDA.d.netinc.2026-04-27.2026-07-26"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $127 billion: operating cash flow of $134 billion less capital spending of $7.4 billion (computed from ten filed figures).","cites":["NVDA.d.ocf.2025-01-27.2025-10-26","NVDA.d.ocf.2025-01-27.2025-07-27","NVDA.d.ocf.2025-01-27.2026-01-25","NVDA.d.ocf.2026-01-26.2026-04-26","NVDA.d.ocf.2026-01-26.2026-07-26","NVDA.d.capex.2025-01-27.2025-10-26","NVDA.d.capex.2025-01-27.2025-07-27","NVDA.d.capex.2025-01-27.2026-01-25","NVDA.d.capex.2026-01-26.2026-04-26","NVDA.d.capex.2026-01-26.2026-07-26"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Remaining performance obligations - revenue under contract that was not yet recognised - were $2.3 billion at the end of FY2026, against $1.7 billion a year earlier. That is 1.1% of FY2026 revenue (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["NVDA.rpo.2026","NVDA.rpo.2025","NVDA.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $2.6 billion at the end of FY2026 (tagged ContractWithCustomerLiability), against $1.8 billion a year earlier.","cites":["NVDA.deferred.2026","NVDA.deferred.2025"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 42,000 in its own words. FY2026 revenue works out to about $5.1 million for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["NVDA.q.employees","NVDA.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2026 the balance sheet carried $10.6 billion in cash and cash equivalents, and $8.5 billion of debt as tagged (LongTermDebtNoncurrent + DebtCurrent). Cash exceeded that debt by $2.1 billion (computed from three filed figures).","cites":["NVDA.cash.2026","NVDA.debtLong.2026","NVDA.debtCurrent.2026"]}]},"fin":{"NVDA":{}},"quotes":{"NVDA.q.employees":{"c":"NVDA","kind":"employees","n":42000,"quote":"As of the end of fiscal year 2026, we had approximately 42,000 employees in 38 countries; 31,000 were engaged in research and development and 11,000 were engaged in sales, marketing, operations, and administrative positions.","source":"NVDA-0001045810-26-000021","section":"Item 1. Business","date":"2026-02-25","proof":"d390e7f16e8d70a1842be386fd8144211f8451982d6040792e1957fa6736eeab"}}}